      </td></tr></table><table><col class="asyn-l"></col><col class="asyn-r"></col><tr><td>&lt;Zdn&gt;</td><td><a id="Zdn"></a>
        
          <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">Is the name of the first source and destination scalable vector register, encoded in the "Zdn" field.</p>
        
      </td></tr></table><table><col class="asyn-l"></col><col class="asyn-r"></col><tr><td>&lt;Zm&gt;</td><td><a id="Zm"></a>
        
